#. macro: <ui-edge-color 501> — text outline color from the UIColor sheet; </ui-edge-color> restores the previous color; color = 501 (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
#. macro: </ui-edge-color> — end of: text outline color from the UIColor sheet; </ui-edge-color> restores the previous color (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
#. macro: </ui-color> — end of: text color from the UIColor sheet; </ui-color> restores the previous color (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
msgctxt "quest/045/BanArk124_04574:TEXT_BANARK124_04574_MARU_000_003:1"
msgid "Three of these delinquents are at this very moment workin' at the Giantsgall Grounds. I think if a fierce-lookin' <if $gn4>woman<else>man</if> like yourself were to <ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>doubt</ui-edge-color></ui-color> their intentions to settle with us, they might think twice before shirkin' their debt again."
msgstr ""

#. ja: 何だ？<br>作業中なんだ、どいてくれ……。
#. de: Was willst du von mir? Ich bin beschäftigt<nbsp>...
#. fr: Qu'est-ce que tu veux<nbsp>? Tu vois pas que je suis en plein travail<nbsp>?
#. speaker: BUSYMAN04574
msgctxt "quest/045/BanArk124_04574:TEXT_BANARK124_04574_BUSYMAN04574_000_010:1"
msgid "Hey, I'm workin' here! I don't have time for chitchat!"
msgstr ""

#. ja: どうやら、話を聞いてくれそうにない。<br>エモート「問い詰める」をしてみよう。
#. de: Der Stammgast scheint dich nicht ernst zu nehmen. Verleih deiner Forderung mit dem Emote „Beschuldigen“ (Textbefehl: /schuld) Nachdruck.
#. fr: Il n'a pas l'air de vouloir vous écouter. Essayez de le <i>questionner</i> avec plus d'insistance.
#. speaker: SYSTEM
#. macro: <ui-color 500> — text color from the UIColor sheet; </ui-color> restores the previous color; color = 500 (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
#. macro: <ui-edge-color 501> — text outline color from the UIColor sheet; </ui-edge-color> restores the previous color; color = 501 (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
#. macro: </ui-edge-color> — end of: text outline color from the UIColor sheet; </ui-edge-color> restores the previous color (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
#. macro: </ui-color> — end of: text color from the UIColor sheet; </ui-color> restores the previous color (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
msgctxt "quest/045/BanArk124_04574:TEXT_BANARK124_04574_SYSTEM_100_010:1"
msgid "This man has no interest in conversation, but a healthy dose of <ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>doubt</ui-edge-color></ui-color> might earn his attention."
msgstr ""

#. ja: えっ、いつツケを支払うのかって……！？<br>ま、待ってくれ、そう怒らずにさ……<br>ほら、これを持っていってくれ。
#. de: Jaja, schon gut! War ja nicht böse gemeint. Hier, das sollte reichen, um meine Rechnung zu begleichen.
#. fr: Quand est-ce que je vais payer mon ardoise<nbsp>? A-attends, pas la peine de s'énerver... Tiens, prends ça.
#. speaker: BUSYMAN04574
msgctxt "quest/045/BanArk124_04574:TEXT_BANARK124_04574_BUSYMAN04574_000_011:1"
msgid "Huh? The Hippo Riders sent you? H-Hey now, you don't have to scowl at me like that. I have their money—here, take it."
msgstr ""

#. ja: 支払いが遅くなっちまったことは、この通り謝るからさ！<br>どうか悪いようには言わないでおくれよ、なっ……！？
#. de: Tut mir leid, dass es etwas länger gedauert hat. Kommt nicht wieder vor!
#. fr: Je suis sincèrement désolé du retard<nbsp>! Arrange-toi pour qu'ils ne m'en veulent pas trop, d'accord<nbsp>?
#. speaker: BUSYMAN04574
msgctxt "quest/045/BanArk124_04574:TEXT_BANARK124_04574_BUSYMAN04574_000_012:1"
msgid "I should've settled up earlier, but you know how things go...right? I'll make the proper apologies soon enough, so you go and tell them how cooperative I was, eh? ...Please?"
msgstr ""

#. ja: ツケてる分の支払いをどうするかって？<br>俺のダチが、あそこの酒場で働いてて話は通してあるよ。<br>それに、別に逃げたりするつもりもないから安心してくれって。
#. de: Was mit meiner Rechnung ist? Na, keine Sorge, ich lauf schon nicht weg! Der Wirt ist doch mein guter Freund.
#. fr: Quoi, le paiement de l'ardoise<nbsp>? Un de mes potes travaille à la taverne, on s'est arrangés. Je compte pas m'enfuir sans payer, t'inquiète.
#. speaker: ONABREAKMAN04574
msgctxt "quest/045/BanArk124_04574:TEXT_BANARK124_04574_ONABREAKMAN04574_000_013:1"
msgid "What, you think I'm some kind of thief!? I'll have you know a friend of mine works at the meyhane, and he's been hounding me to no end. Don't worry—if I was going to run, I'd have done it already."
msgstr ""

#. ja: どうやら、あまり気にしていないようだ。<br>エモート「問い詰める」をしてみよう。
#. de: Der Stammgast scheint dich nicht ernst zu nehmen. Verleih deiner Forderung mit dem Emote „Beschuldigen“ (Textbefehl: /schuld) Nachdruck.
#. fr: Il n'a pas l'air très préoccupé par le sujet... Essayez de le <i>questionner</i> avec plus d'insistance.
#. speaker: SYSTEM
#. macro: <ui-color 500> — text color from the UIColor sheet; </ui-color> restores the previous color; color = 500 (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
#. macro: <ui-edge-color 501> — text outline color from the UIColor sheet; </ui-edge-color> restores the previous color; color = 501 (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
#. macro: </ui-edge-color> — end of: text outline color from the UIColor sheet; </ui-edge-color> restores the previous color (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
#. macro: </ui-color> — end of: text color from the UIColor sheet; </ui-color> restores the previous color (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
msgctxt "quest/045/BanArk124_04574:TEXT_BANARK124_04574_SYSTEM_100_013:1"
msgid "He doesn't seem too worried about his mounting debt. Perhaps you make him <ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>doubt</ui-edge-color></ui-color> his current financial strategy."
msgstr ""

#. ja: ……ん、そんなに怒ってる感じなのか？<br>それはちょいと、想定外だったな。
#. de: Huch, der Wirt meint es also wirklich ernst?! Das war mir nicht klar.
#. fr: Il est si énervé que ça<nbsp>? Je pensais pas...
#. speaker: ONABREAKMAN04574
#. macro: <i> — italic text (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
#. macro: </i> — end of: italic text (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
msgctxt "quest/045/BanArk124_04574:TEXT_BANARK124_04574_ONABREAKMAN04574_000_014:1"
msgid "...Huh? You're really in a fit of pique, aren't you? I didn't know the meyhane needed funds <i>that</i> badly."
msgstr ""

#. ja: 出入り禁止にされるのはイヤだし、<br>今度行くときに、キッチリこれまでの分を持っていくとするよ。<br>確かにそう言ってたって、伝えておいてくれるか？
#. de: Ich habe keine Lust, Hausverbot zu bekommen. Bitte richte ihm aus, dass ich bei meinem nächsten Besuch alles bezahlen werde.
#. fr: J'aimerais pas être interdit d'entrée, je paierai la prochaine fois que j'irai sur place. Tu veux bien transmettre le message<nbsp>?
#. speaker: ONABREAKMAN04574
msgctxt "quest/045/BanArk124_04574:TEXT_BANARK124_04574_ONABREAKMAN04574_000_015:1"
msgid "All right, all right, I'll pay what I owe. Don't know what I'd do with my evenings if I couldn't spend them at the meyhane. You go ahead and tell Maru I'll be along with his money within the bell."
msgstr ""

#. ja: すみません。<br>ちょっと忙しいので、お話ならまた今度に……。
#. de: Entschuldige, aber ich habe gerade keine Zeit<nbsp>...
#. fr: Désolée, mais je suis occupée, là...
#. speaker: CHECKINGWOMAN04574
#. macro: <if $gn4>miss<else>mister</if> — shows the first branch when the condition holds, otherwise the branch after <else>; condition = global number 4 (1 when the player character is female, 0 when male) (condition: may be reworded, restructured, added, or dropped)
msgctxt "quest/045/BanArk124_04574:TEXT_BANARK124_04574_CHECKINGWOMAN04574_000_016:1"
msgid "Excuse me, <if $gn4>miss<else>mister</if>, but as you can see, I'm quite busy..."
msgstr ""

#. ja: どうやら、話を聞いてくれそうにない。<br>エモート「問い詰める」をしてみよう。
#. de: Der Stammgast scheint dich nicht ernst zu nehmen. Verleih deiner Forderung mit dem Emote „Beschuldigen“ (Textbefehl: /schuld) Nachdruck.
#. fr: Elle n'a pas l'air de vouloir vous écouter. Essayez de la <i>questionner</i> avec plus d'insistance.
#. speaker: SYSTEM
#. macro: <ui-color 500> — text color from the UIColor sheet; </ui-color> restores the previous color; color = 500 (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
#. macro: <ui-edge-color 501> — text outline color from the UIColor sheet; </ui-edge-color> restores the previous color; color = 501 (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
#. macro: </ui-edge-color> — end of: text outline color from the UIColor sheet; </ui-edge-color> restores the previous color (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
#. macro: </ui-color> — end of: text color from the UIColor sheet; </ui-color> restores the previous color (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
msgctxt "quest/045/BanArk124_04574:TEXT_BANARK124_04574_SYSTEM_100_016:1"
msgid "She seems distracted by her work. Make her <ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>doubt</ui-edge-color></ui-color> her priorities."
msgstr ""

#. ja: ええっ！<br>ツケが、そんなに溜まってるんですか！？<br>いつも会計の頃の記憶がないから、払ってたとばかり……！
#. de: Huch, so viel schulde ich dem Wirt?! Ehrlich gesagt sind meine Erinnerungen an die Abende etwas schummrig. Ich dachte, ich hätte alles bezahlt.
#. fr: Quoi, j'ai tant de paiements en retard<nbsp>!? Mince alors, je croyais avoir déjà tout réglé...
#. speaker: CHECKINGWOMAN04574
#. macro: <i> — italic text (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
#. macro: </i> — end of: italic text (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
msgctxt "quest/045/BanArk124_04574:TEXT_BANARK124_04574_CHECKINGWOMAN04574_000_017:1"
msgid "What!? You said I owe <i>how</i> much!? I'm embarrassed to say, but I'm always four sheets to the wind by the time I settle the bill..."
msgstr ""

#. ja: これを持っていってくれるかしら？<br>迷惑料込みでも、きっと足りるはずだから……<br>あと、本当にごめんなさいって代わりに言っておいてくれる？
#. de: Hier, das sollte reichen, um meine Schulden zu bezahlen. Der Rest ist eine Wieder<shy>gut<shy>machung für die Umstände, die ich bereitet habe. Bitte sag dem Wirt, dass es mir leidtut.
#. fr: Tiens, prends cet argent, il devrait y en avoir assez... Et transmets-leur mes excuses, s'il te plaît.
#. speaker: CHECKINGWOMAN04574
msgctxt "quest/045/BanArk124_04574:TEXT_BANARK124_04574_CHECKINGWOMAN04574_000_018:1"
msgid "Can you take this to the kind people at Svarna? I've even put in a bit extra by way of apology for my...oversight. And while I'll tell them myself when next I see them, for now I'd be grateful if you apologized in my stead."
msgstr ""

#. ja: 首尾はどうだった……？
#. de: Wie ist es gelaufen?
#. fr: Alors, comment ça s'est passé<nbsp>?
#. speaker: MARU
msgctxt "quest/045/BanArk124_04574:TEXT_BANARK124_04574_MARU_000_020:1"
msgid "I hope there wasn't any trouble. While they can be surly with a few drinks in 'em, they're good-natured in the daylight. Or so I hope."
msgstr ""

#. ja: 上手く話を付けてくれたんだね、助かったよ……。<br>実は、ボクたちの仲間も、知り合いや家族が、<br>何人か、ギガントガル採石場で働いているんだよね。
#. de: Danke, dass du uns Gehör verschafft hast. Auf dem Gallenerz-Feld arbeiten viele Freunde von uns.
#. fr: Oh, alors tu as réussi à les convaincre, tant mieux... Nos camarades ont aussi de la famille ou des amis qui travaillent aux mines.
#. speaker: MARU
msgctxt "quest/045/BanArk124_04574:TEXT_BANARK124_04574_MARU_000_021:1"
msgid "Well, well─you're still plenty persuasive, it seems. Truth be told, more'n a few of the quarriers comin' to the meyhane to blow off steam are friends and relatives of the good folks helpin' us out here in Svarna."
msgstr ""

#. ja: だから仲も良くって、仕事の話も弾むんだ。<br>毎回せっつくのはどうかと思って、黙ってたんだけど、<br>もうちょっと厳しくしないとダメかもね……。
#. de: Wir waren wohl etwas zu nachlässig mit ihnen. In Zukunft müssen wir strenger sein.
#. fr: Il y avait une bonne ambiance, alors on ne voulait pas leur rappeler à chaque fois... On sera un peu plus stricts dorénavant.
#. speaker: MARU
msgctxt "quest/045/BanArk124_04574:TEXT_BANARK124_04574_MARU_000_022:1"
msgid "In the interest of maintainin' good relations, I never pestered them overmuch, but now I'm comin' to realize that some just can't help takin' a malm if you give them an ilm."
msgstr ""

#. ja: 酒場の亭主にも、相談しておくとするよ。<br>協力してくれて、ありがとー。
#. de: Ich werde mit dem Wirt darüber sprechen. Er soll sich ein Beispiel an dir nehmen!
#. fr: J'en parlerai au tavernier. Merci pour ton aide<nbsp>!
#. speaker: MARU
#. macro: <split " " 1><string $gs1></split> — the first name of the player character (game data: keep it; it may move or repeat)
#. macro: <string $gs1> — a text value passed to the string; value = global text 1 (the name of the player character) (game data: keep it; it may move or repeat)
msgctxt "quest/045/BanArk124_04574:TEXT_BANARK124_04574_MARU_000_023:1"
msgid "I'll have a talk with the proprietor about how we should deal with this problem in the future... I'm thinkin' we'll be needin' a solution sooner rather than later. Thanks for your help today, <split \" \" 1><string $gs1></split>."
msgstr ""
